{"source": "hl365", "article_key": "221899", "url": "https://hl365.com/archives/221899.html", "title": "湖北女子雷霄 为抢购最新iPhone18ProMax 选择裸贷被朋友抓包 裸贷视频泄密", "published_at": "2026-09-19T07:04:00Z", "html": "\n<p>苹果9月18日刚把最新一代机皇iPhone18推到台前，立刻炸出一堆抢购乱象，最奇葩的当属湖北女子雷霄。她平时消费一向克制，却在新机发布后产生强烈购买欲，最终偷偷摸摸找了裸贷口子，只为把最新款iPhone18ProMax弄到手。上班时同事们还在讨论分期和以旧换新，她却已经完成高风险借贷。不料男友在聊天里察觉异常，她先撒谎说没钱、刚毕业工资才五千多，后来又被追问旧手机卡顿想换新，最终男友直接拿到她的裸贷照片，当场抓包并威胁要发给全家。聊天记录里她一路求饶认错</p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 1\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-2e3d70a2fbe6.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 2\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-567bdf13bc81.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 3\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-410b3f5be3a9.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 4\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-c0221f579109.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 5\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-9c196839a4ad.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 6\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-8cbba9c5430d.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 7\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-e92bb2c6483a.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 8\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-a466cc08dcac.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 9\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-5ccca426bd1d.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 10\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-2965e398f5c4.jpg\"/></p><h2>男友聊天追问雷霄买手机资金来源</h2><p>从最初的“宝宝你给我买了吗”到雷霄反复强调没钱、工资低、要生活，再到男友指出她前两天刚花三千多买包、现在又要最新ProMax，对话一步步把她逼到角落。男友提到官网缺货、黄牛加价太贵，她却急着想快点拿到，直到最后被同事消息戳穿已经换机，整段聊天充满火药味，把她偷偷裸贷的真相一点点揭开。</p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 11\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-ebeab6bc9513.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 12\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-097939fb526c.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 13\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-a7d65c295679.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 14\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-307dfb6f60b1.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 15\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-a154ab0f43c3.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 16\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-794fb4ca54b6.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 17\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-2428f89470f6.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 18\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-346f88a8159b.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 19\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-219886226cb2.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"湖北女子雷霄 20\" src=\"hl365/221899/img-e16708a08d5f.jpg\"/></p><h2>雷霄裸贷照片被男友截获后威胁发全家</h2><p>男友拿到她手持证件的全裸自拍后直接质问“裸贷？？”，并扬言要发给全家看。雷霄瞬间慌乱求饶“别啊宝宝我错了”，还发了语音，但男友骂她“脸都被你这种人丢尽了滚蛋吧”。照片里她一丝不挂站在镜子前，手里举着证件，画面清晰冲击力极强，整件事瞬间从普通消费纠纷升级成全网围观的翻车现场。</p><p><div class=\"dplayer defplay\" data-config='{\"live\":false,\"autoplay\":false,\"theme\":\"#FADFA3\",\"loop\":false,\"screenshot\":false,\"hotkey\":true,\"preload\":\"metadata\",\"lang\":\"zh-cn\",\"logo\":null,\"volume\":0.69999999999999996,\"mutex\":true,\"video_ads_url\":\"https://pic.hdhwqx.cn/hc237/uploads/default/other/2026-08-28/3a8e253a13ff8765ca0a467e18bec6bd.gif\",\"video_ads_url_h\":\"https://pic.hdhwqx.cn/hc237/uploads/default/other/2026-08-28/d0436d77cef0e6f75b546affc8902173.gif\",\"ads_jump_url\":\"https://agdux527.com\",\"backend_video_ads_url\":\"https://op.udhhzr.cn/videos5/6d82ede33b5c6086d1ad9e3ec746578c/6d82ede33b5c6086d1ad9e3ec746578c.m3u8?auth_key=1789802777-6aae3919ae62c-0-61c5af59cc412eeae833807135b1dc05\\u0026v=3\\u0026time=0\\u0026project_id=tj005\\u0026pv=1\",\"backend_video_ads_url_h\":\"https://op.udhhzr.cn/videos5/5cfb37e5095013f25a164cd5772944d0/5cfb37e5095013f25a164cd5772944d0.m3u8?auth_key=1789802777-6aae3919ae637-0-a624fd84466777881f4d8ee3e92feb14\\u0026v=3\\u0026time=0\\u0026project_id=tj005\\u0026pv=1\",\"backend_ads_jump_url\":\"https://12d72.wlqdrgah.cc\",\"pre_ads\":[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"https://agdux527.com\",\"link_h\":\"https://agdux527.com\",\"url\":\"https://pic.hdhwqx.cn/hc237/uploads/default/other/2026-08-28/3a8e253a13ff8765ca0a467e18bec6bd.gif\",\"url_h\":\"https://pic.hdhwqx.cn/hc237/uploads/default/other/2026-08-28/d0436d77cef0e6f75b546affc8902173.gif\",\"duration\":5,\"meta\":{\"ad_id\":\"2091459399558901762\",\"creative_id\":\"200470\",\"ad_slot_key\":\"advert_player_pre_vertical\",\"ad_slot_name\":\"player_pre_vertical\",\"ad_type\":\"image\",\"page_key\":\"player\",\"page_name\":\"播放器\"},\"meta_h\":{\"ad_id\":\"2091459399558901761\",\"creative_id\":\"200471\",\"ad_slot_key\":